  "description": "<p>Range <strong>60ft cone</strong>, <strong>1 minute per level</strong> (concentration).</p><ul><li>Each round you focus on one creature in the cone and read its surface thoughts; <strong>Will negates</strong> for that creature (it knows nothing has been read).</li><li>Stone <strong>3ft</strong> thick, lead or metal sheets block it.</li><li>Cast reversed (Obscure Thoughts), one touched creature is immune to thought detection for the same duration.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Reversible:</strong> may be cast as its opposite with the same slot.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Wizard, Illusionist, Warlock, Bard, Necromancer, Witch</p>",
